{"unit_id":"tag:0CFV:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。设<MATH_0004>是光滑（smooth）覆盖（covering），覆盖<MATH_0005>。则存在平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>，覆盖<MATH_0007>，并加细（refines）<MATH_0008>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"给定覆盖的性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"给定或所构造的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"所构造覆盖的性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细","context":"覆盖之间的关系；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0CFV:proof","translation":"先选择概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>及满射（surjective）的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>。对每个<MATH_0003>选择概形（scheme）<MATH_0004>及满射（surjective）的平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>。则<MATH_0006>是光滑（smooth）覆盖（covering），它加细（refines）<MATH_0007>。因此<MATH_0008>是概形（schemes）的光滑（smooth）覆盖（covering）。由《态射（Morphisms）进阶》引理<REF_0001>，可选取平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0009>，它加细（refines）<MATH_0010>。于是<MATH_0011>是平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）覆盖（covering），加细（refining）<MATH_0012>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0004>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"加细"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"覆盖的源；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"覆盖态射的满射性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"首次选取的覆盖态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"各分量上的覆盖态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"给定覆盖的